    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How can I contact Customer Service?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Phone: 877-554-7868 (Mon–Fri, 9 AM–5 PM CST)</p><p>Email: CustomerService@GruntStyle.com</p><p>Chat: Mon–Fri, 9 AM–5 PM CST</p><p>Visit: <a href=\"/pages/grunt-style-retail-stores\" target=\"_blank\">Retail Locations</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's your return policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Grunt Style will accept your return of unworn, unwashed, like new condition (per Grunt Style discretion) and defective merchandise by mail for a full refund of the purchase price (excluding shipping costs) if the merchandise is returned within 60 days of receipt.</li><li>Eligible refunds made within 60 days after receipt will be credited for the item's purchase price in the original form of payment.</li><li>Any other return/exchange will fall under the policy for merchandise credit or merchandise swap.</li><li>Purchases of third-party brands like EGO Cases, Grill Your Ass Off, Soledier Socks, or others are not eligible for coverage under our Beer Guarantee policy.</li></ul><p>Full details can be found here: <a href=\"/pages/returns\">/pages/returns </a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does Free Shipping work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>If you are part of the Member tier, or Guest you must have a subtotal of $75 to receive free shipping!</p><p>If you’re a Silver or Gold member, you receive free shipping! Make sure you’re signed in and it automatically applies.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does Grunt Style Rewards work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Members must be signed in for perks to apply instantly online. At a retail store, share your email for perks to apply.</p><p>No minimum spend required.</p><p>Credits are valid for 90 days. Use them before they disappear.</p><p>Earn 5-20% in Credit on spend, Birthday Credit, and other perks!</p><p><a href=\"/community/membership\">Click here</a> to see each tiers' perks!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you ship internationally?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Would a statue of George Washington astride a bald eagle look epic on top of the white house? Yes. If you have trouble navigating the checkout process for international shipments, contact Customer Service.<br/><br/>For APO/FPO addresses, please ensure that your shipping information is properly formatted to fight against errors in our shipping systems. Here is an example of a properly formatted address:<br/><br/>NAME: JOHN DOE<br/>COMPANY (FPO ONLY): USS Grunt Style<br/>STREET 1: UNIT/PSC 1234<br/>STREET 2: BOX 1234<br/>CITY: APO/FPO<br/>STATE: ARMED FORCES PACIFIC<br/>COUNTRY: UNITED STATES<br/>ZIP: 00000-0000<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where’s my return?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Likely still shipping to us. We’ll contact you via email as soon as we receive the item and are processing it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
